# @no-redirect
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@apiKey = test
@whitelistUrl = https://wl-api.mf.gov.pl/api/search/nip
@jdgNip = 7272445205
@companyNip = 6252447933

### List single proprietorship in WhiteList
< {% request.variables.set("date", new Date().toISOString().substring(0, 10)); %}
GET {{whitelistUrl}}/{{jdgNip}}?date={{date}}
Accept: application/json

### List company in WhiteList
< {% request.variables.set("date", new Date().toISOString().substring(0, 10)); %}
GET {{whitelistUrl}}/{{companyNip}}?date={{date}}
Accept: application/json

### List non-existing NIP should fail
< {% request.variables.set("date", new Date().toISOString().substring(0, 10)); %}
GET {{whitelistUrl}}/0000000000?date={{date}}
Accept: application/json

### List sole propietorship from lookup entrypoint should succeed
GET {{baseUrl}}/gov/vat-lb?nip={{jdgNip}}
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### List company from lookup entrypoint should succeed
GET {{baseUrl}}/gov/vat-lb?nip={{companyNip}}
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}